<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.41 vs   0.78</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.38 vs   1.48</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.52 vs   1.52</p>
<p> Sales		   24.54 vs  18.89</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.73 vs   4.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.22 vs   6.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.03 vs   6.09</p>
<p> Sales		  129.59 vs 106.49</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat firm is Sokolowskie Zaklady</p>
<p>Miesne SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
